    {
      "text": "A page from a CVSource (投中信息) Chinese-language investment-research report headed \"全球：中企IPO首日破发率43.75%\" (global: 43.75% of Chinese-company IPOs broke issue on day one). Two ranked tables give the top five first-day risers and fallers for April 2024, and a horizontal bar chart below shows the distribution of first-day moves across bands from -60%,-30% up to 240%,270%.",
